BranchTraits: {
	Charger: Charger:  Left-click to thrust; right-click for a long-distance charge with a cooldown
	PrimalCaster: Primal Caster:  Release homing violet flames and create allied servants when nearby enemies die
	Fortress: Fortress:  Bombard distant enemies with grenades and use a shield to guard and counterattack
	Summoner: Summoner:  Deploy drones and switch modules for different attacks and control effects
}
